hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"23622","Waki' narrated to us from Isra'il from Abu Ishaq from Yahya ibn al-Husayn from his mother, she said: I heard the Prophet, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, delivering the sermon in the Farewell Hajj, saying: O people, fear Allah, and hear and obey, even if an Abyssinian mutilated slave is appointed over you, as long as he upholds among you the Book of Allah Almighty."
